    "paragraph": "Three fenced parks sit within a short drive of each other, and a tired dog is a happy dog. Start at the big field with the agility ramps, move to the shady one by the river when it gets warm, and end at the small park with the water fountain for dogs. Bring a ball you do not mind losing. The regulars all know each other's dogs by name and will learn yours by the second visit.",
