    "title": "Catch a free movie on a Tuesday",
    "theme": "free",
    "paragraph": "The old film house on the waterfront shows a classic for free every Tuesday evening, and the seats are better than they have any right to be. Get there twenty minutes early, because the good rows go first. Walk the lakeside path afterward while you argue about the ending, and stop at the pier if the sky is doing anything. It is the cheapest good night in town, and almost nobody knows about it.",
