    "theme": "winter",
    "paragraph": "The lifts keep running after dark on winter weeknights, and the trails are half empty once the day crowd goes home. Leave the office at five, be on the snow by six, and get in a dozen runs before the lodge closes. The cold is real up there, so bring a layer more than you think you need. A bowl of chili in the lodge afterward is the reward, and the drive home is quiet.",
